Z||000000||hugh||03-26-2001||08:04 PM||||My 88 GT now has coilovers all the way around.The alignment is going to be done this Wednesday.Since my height is now adjustable what is a good height to set the car at?I would like it low,but not so low that I have clearance problems.My car also weighs 2200 lbs.in the rear with a full tank and me in it.What would anyone suggest as a minimum road clearance?I also would like to be sure the alignment specs I have will be the best since my car is so rear heavy.||||reg||1
